Z||000000||Jim Keyton||05-04-2001||07:29 PM||||For those wondering this is a really nice muffler, very well made.<BR>Had it put on this morning using dual three inch outlets, slant cut, rolled edge.<BR>Somewhat louder than stock, really sounds nice. I have an 88 GT with auto, so run down from speed does not produce any popping.<BR>It does cause heads to turn when you wack it.<BR>Thank you West Coast Fiero!<BR>Jim||||reg||1
